OL,3,ASpeedboat killer jailed for attack on
OL,4,Agirlfriend
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2018 he was originally jailed for
OL,7,Fsix years for manslaughter over the
OL,8,Fdeath of 24-year-old Charlotte Brown
OL,9,Fwhen his speedboat crashed during a
OL,10,Ffirst date.
